I think we calculated that with a ring of slow digestion you could
rely on praying for food indefinitely.  From
http://www.statslab.cam.ac.uk/~eva/nethack/iaq.html#survive :

|If you pray successfully while starving, your nutrition level is set
|to 900. Assuming that you only consume one nutrition point every 20
|turns (e.g., you are either a human wearing a ring of slow digestion
|or a xorn wearing an amulet of unchanging), it will take 18000 turns
|for your nutrition level to reach 0 (Fainting). This is more than
|enough time to ensure that you will be able to pray.

